{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Steam Next Fest Demo only includes early versions of Local Mode and Streamer Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/extras/Recognize.gif?t=1742829298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Impostor is a unique social deception game, where you play either as an impostor, pretending to be an AI, or as the detective, who is trying to expose the impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The detective picks a question for the impostor to answer. The impostor must write an answer which will sound like it is AI-written. The impostor loses the round if he is exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/extras/Guess.gif?t=1742829298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several game modes, each of which puts a new spin on this system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaign Mode -</strong> Hone your human-detection skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Mode -</strong> Play with other friends who own the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Mode -</strong> Play locally on one computer, taking turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Streamer Mode -</strong>\u00a0Play with your stream chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/extras/Deceive.gif?t=1742829298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently in the process of being tested and built in public, and should be ready around March.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3110320?t=1742829298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3110320?t=1742829298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/d4c5025c9aada99d613ac322812889531c2a5570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742829298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/d4c5025c9aada99d613ac322812889531c2a5570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742829298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3546940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Steam Next Fest Demo only includes early versions of Local Mode and Streamer Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/extras/Recognize.gif?t=1742829298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Impostor is a unique social deception game, where you play either as an impostor, pretending to be an AI, or as the detective, who is trying to expose the impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The detective picks a question for the impostor to answer. The impostor must write an answer which will sound like it is AI-written. The impostor loses the round if he is exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/extras/Guess.gif?t=1742829298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several game modes, each of which puts a new spin on this system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaign Mode -</strong> Hone your human-detection skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Mode -</strong> Play with other friends who own the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Mode -</strong> Play locally on one computer, taking turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Streamer Mode -</strong>\u00a0Play with your stream chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/extras/Deceive.gif?t=1742829298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently in the process of being tested and built in public, and should be ready around March.</p>","developers":["Shutterframe Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/header.jpg?t=1742829298","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Impostor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Shutterframe Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/ac09815dcf7753f3d747968a7c06fc1e2a531673/ss_ac09815dcf7753f3d747968a7c06fc1e2a531673.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742829298","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110320/ac09815dcf7753f3d747968a7c06fc1e2a531673/ss_ac09815dcf7753f3d747968a7c06fc1e2a531673.600x33